{"id":"n1-184","title":"～こととて","romaji":"〜koto tote","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Used to express the reason or premise for a decision or judgment; 'since', 'because'.","longExplanation":"The ～こととて grammar point expresses a reason or premise in a slightly formal or literary way. It can often be interpreted as 'since' or 'because'.","formation":"Verb (plain form) + こととて / Noun + の + こととて / (な-Adjective + な) + こととて","examples":[{"jp":"彼は裁判に勝つために全資産を使うこととて、弁護士に頼んだ。","romaji":"Kare wa saiban ni katsu tame ni zenshisan o tsukau koto tote, bengoshi ni tanonda.","en":"Since he's using all his assets to win the trial, he hired a lawyer.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"裁判","vocabId":"1296120","reading":"さいばん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勝つ","vocabId":"1346150","reading":"かつ"},{"surface":"ため","vocabId":"1157080","reading":"ため"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"全","vocabId":null},{"surface":"資産","vocabId":"1312750","reading":"しさん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"使う","vocabId":"1305990","reading":"つかう"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"弁護士","vocabId":"1512850","reading":"べんごし"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"頼んだ","vocabId":"1548370","reading":"たのんだ","baseForm":"頼む"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[11,12,13]},{"jp":"明日は大切な試験があることとて、今夜は早く寝ます。","romaji":"Ashita wa taisetsu na shiken ga aru koto tote, konya wa hayaku nemasu.","en":"Since I have an important exam tomorrow, I’m going to bed early tonight.","words":[{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大切","vocabId":"1414340","reading":"たいせつ"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ある","vocabId":"1296400","r